My feet... aren't touching the floor. 

I'm floating. 

...Am I dreaming? 

#[Cue Birthday Party Ambience]

Wait...

Everyone is here.

Everyone is shouting my name.

#[Pili is beaming with an orange juice container in her hands.]

Nanay is smiling. 

#[Valerie is gently bouncing Kiki who is giggling and reaching for a floating balloon. Dodong is grinning as he shares the screen of his gameboy with Noni.]

My siblings aren't bickering. 

#[Ernesto looks relaxed and is trying to adjust the pabitin]

Tatay is not tired. 

#[Ritchie has chocolate frosting on his chin as he laughs loudly. He is clutching a plastic lootbag]

And the sky looks happy to celebrate my birthday too.

#[Cue Raw and Authentic Birthday Song]

“Happy Birthday Ollie!”

Everything is moving so slow but ... I don’t feel scared.

I feel warm.

PILI:
"Blow the candle, anak! Make a wish!" 

I don't know what to ask for. 

Oh, wait... no, I want to wish for this party to happen right now! 

...

If this is what turning eight feels like... I don't need a wish. I just wanna stay here.
Forever and ever.

#[Ollie smiles then they blow out the candle flame.]

#[FADE TO BLACK]

=> END